#+title: Manifolding Mindmap Sync

Automatic mind-map ownership and generation. Locked law: every file
is a node; a node belongs to multiple maps only hierarchically (one
directory level up/down); no two map files in one directory; lower
maps embed fully expanded into upper maps; files are the source of
truth; secondary membership is derived, never stored.

* Mindmap Sync :EMACS_MECHANISM:
:PROPERTIES:
:ID:       4eb48722-387c-49c4-b875-3842c340fb58
:MM_PARENT: none
:MM_ORDER:  128.0
:END:

** Drawer keys (live properties)
MM_MAP (primary map file id), MM_PARENT (parent node in map),
MM_ORDER (shared float: boot order follows map order), MM_KIND
("map" on map files only), MM_ANCHOR (heading id the card mirrors).
Secondary membership is derived from directory adjacency only.
